; 1CompleteCustomZigZag
; Bambu Lab P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / supplied PETG profile / High Temp Plate
; 12 layers, 0.06 mm layer height, maximum object Z 0.72 mm
; Layer 1: 10 mm/s (F600); layers 2-8: 20 mm/s (F1200); base geometry/extrusion unchanged
; Layers 9-12: two custom continuous paths, F60 (1 mm/s), width 0.15 mm
; Custom path: 21 sharp tips, 0.3 mm pitch; red/right path mirrored toward blue/left path
; P1S startup retained with 255 C hot target, 225 C pre-wipe cooldown, original 140 C wipe
; Printing temperatures: nozzle 255 C, bed 80 C; purge-line XY speed 25 mm/s (F1500)
; Original source time and filament estimates omitted; not a printer-tested file
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
M201 X20000 Y20000 Z500 E5000
M203 X500 Y500 Z20 E30
M204 P20000 R5000 T20000
M205 X9.00 Y9.00 Z3.00 E2.50 ; sets the jerk limits, mm/sec
M106 S0
M106 P2 S0
